<title>UK: ABN AMRO sets warrants on the CAC40 index.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets warrants on the CAC40 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO BANK NV has issued a total of four million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the CAC40 index, lead manager ABN AMRO Finance SA said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   31.DEC.98		 LISTING	PARIS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1,000</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT    STRIKE     ISSUE	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A     2,700 FFR  25.2 FFR   10.42 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B     2,900 FFR  17.6 FFR   14.91 TIMES  PUT C     2,500</p>
<p> FFR 22.3 FFR</p>
<p> 11.77 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D     2,300 FFR  15.3 FFR   17.16 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
